# Clipboard (0.0.5h): dragging over the terminal selects text and copies
# it; Ctrl+V pastes it back as input. The terminal frame is 56,56 740x470
# (content from 57,89); its text starts at 63,95 in 8x16 cells. The second
# line printed is "init: started as pid 1" at y=135; dragging from the
# start of "started" (col 6) to the end of "pid" (col 17) selects
# "started as pid", and "echo " + paste + Enter echoes it.
gui: desktop up at 1280x800
cerberus kernel shell
!mouseto 112 139
!button left down
!mouse 112 0
!wait 0.2
!screenshot build/clip-1.png
!button left up
!wait 0.3
!keys e
!keys c
!keys h
!keys o
!keys spc
!keys ctrl v
!wait 0.3
!keys ret
!wait 1
cerberus> echo started as pid
started as pid
